      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, i get that, but if we spend half the intro talking about the tragedy and the loss, it's not really an exhibit about expansion anymore, is it? it just turns into a memorial. isn't it more important to highlight the bravery and the building of the nation that actually created the US we know today? wouldn't that be a more uplifting and accurate way to represent that era's impact?",
